ress toward the next gym. Grinding/catching/detours are fine — but ONLY with a clear purpose, and then you GET BACK ON THE ROAD to Vermilion City. Never just circle the same grass. ⚠️ ORDER OF OPERATIONS: before Lt. Surge, HM Surf — the prize of the Safari Zone\'s Secret House, deep in the back area. Surf opens the sea: Cinnabar, the Seafoam route, and Victory Road\'s water — that errand comes FIRST (it unblocks the road and the trainers along it are exactly the training you need). Lt. Surge is step two, not a competing choice. Word on the road about Lt. Surge: the lightning American — ELECTRIC-types; ground moves shut his whole act down YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): You started in Pallet Town, beat Brock in Pewter (Boulder Badge), fought up Route 3 and through the Mt. Moon cave — a real maze you nearly got lost in — reached Cerulean City, and beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Now you\'re after your third gym.. Next on my list: catch an pikachu around Viridian Forest (rare) / Power Plant later. It grows into my raichu — that\'s my answer for Lorelei AND Lance down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "LT. SURGE installed the traps in the GYM himself. He set up double locks everywhere. Let me give you a hint. When you open the first lock, the second lock is ri"; "LT. SURGE installed the traps in the GYM himself. He set up double locks everywhere. Let me give you a hint. When you open the first lock, the second lock is ri"; "VERMILION POK.MON GYM LEADER. LT. SURGE WINNING TRAINERS. GARY"; "I\'m a lightweight, but I\'m good with electricity! That\'s why I joined this GYM.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and head to Vermilion City for the Thunder Badge. Next: You CRUSHED Misty — ride the momentum: Lt. Surge in Vermilion City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training. Bigger picture: Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge. Your team right now: blastoise (L36), ekans (L13), spearow (L17), abra (L14), rattata (L14), caterpie the butterfree (L13). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "2 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade). Next gym: Lt. Surge of Vermilion City. Pokédex: 10 caught. She's two badges down, a quarter of the way (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'blastoise (L36), ekans (L13), spearow (L17), abra (L14), rattata (L14), caterpie the butterfree (L13)', 'goal': {'short': "You're ready — stop grinding and head to Vermilion City for the Thunder Badge", 'medium': 'You CRUSHED Misty — ride the momentum: Lt. Surge in Vermilion City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training', 'long': 'Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge'}} options=['regroup']

